  <Kiiro.strategyOption_PostDesc>將富有張力與吸引力的藝術廣告張貼在{0}各處以招攬這個村鎮的商戶前來入駐。選用這項招募策略需要藝術與智識。\n\n你的遠行隊里最合適的人選是{1}，由{1}來主導這次招募的話，成功招募到商戶的概率大約為{2}。</Kiiro.strategyOption_PostDesc>
  <!-- EN: Visit specific merchants in {0} with gifts, and sincerely communicate and negotiate about settling in.This recruitment strategy requires negotiation skills.\n\nMost suitable person in your caravan is {1} who shall recruit merchants with a chance of {2} if in charge. -->
  <Kiiro.strategyOption_VisitDesc>帶上見面禮物登門拜訪{0}中特定的商戶，情真意切地交流和磋商入駐事宜。選用這項招募策略需要談判能力。\n\n你的遠行隊里最合適的人選是{1}，由{1}來主導這次招募的成功率大約為{2}。</Kiiro.strategyOption_VisitDesc>
  <!-- EN: Set up a temporary wooden stage in the town center of {0}, gather merchants for on-site recruitment speeches, and answer questions raised by merchants. This recruitment strategy requires social skills and knowledge.\n\nMost suitable person in your caravan is {1} who shall recruit merchants with a chance of {2} if in charge. -->
  <Kiiro.strategyOption_LectureDesc>在{0}的城鎮中心搭起臨時的木臺，召集商戶們進行現場招募宣講並解答商戶提出的疑問。選用這項招募策略需要社交與智識。\n\n你的遠行隊里最合適的人選是{1}，由{1}來主導這次招募的話，招募到至少一個商戶的概率大約為{2}。</Kiiro.strategyOption_LectureDesc>
  
