  <!-- 貿易節日提議 -->
  <!-- EN: More and more merchants are settling in. To celebrate the successful opening of their shops in the colony, {0} and the other merchants have discussed and agreed that a Trade Festival should be established. During the festival, they plan to sell goods at discounted prices, raise the purchase prices of items, and invite nearby caravans to visit.\n\nAs the host, you believe the most suitable date for the Trade Festival would be: -->
  <Kiiro.TradeFestivalSuggest>入駐的商舖越來越多了。爲了紀念大家的商舖在殖民地順利開張，{0}與其他商戶們討論后一致認為應該設立一個貿易的節日。大家打算在節日期間以折扣的價格售賣商品、提高收購物品的出價以及邀請附近商隊來訪。\n\n作為東道主，你認為貿易節日的日期比較適合設定在：</Kiiro.TradeFestivalSuggest>

</LanguageData>